	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>Lake Tahoe Fire Academy | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="The South Lake Tahoe Community College Fire Academy trains dedicated, service-oriented students for careers in fire suppression and management. LTCCFA cadets receive hands-on training from experienced professionals and graduate with the necessary certifications to work in wildland or structural firefighting at various levels. The academy is a two-quarter program offered in partnership with local fire districts, with classes held at South Lake Tahoe and Carson City, NV and transportation support available for cadets." />
	</ouc:properties>

